    "body": "Hands-on check (contributor, macOS release build, 2026-11-09):\n- **Mesh state:** the rows read JawHi/JawLo `mesh` and JawOpen `box only: open mesh`, and the Fixtures page shows each fixture's Collision line.\n- **Highlight:** Face1's banner shows \"Strikes fixture: JawLo - tinted in the viewport while selected\". This was checked in wireframe view.\n- **Mark/unmark:** Clamp → Use as fixture lands under Fixtures as `mesh`, and undo/redo works.\n- **Import:** `vise-jaw-open.stl` lands as `box only` with the status \"imported …; marked as a fixture\". One Cmd+Z removes it completely.\n- **Skipped:** the unresolved-fixture case (step 3) was not run by hand. `fixture_ux` pins it.\n- **Filed from this pass:** #506 (pale tree text on the light panel) and #509 (Fixtures page rows overflow, place fields unlabelled). Neither blocks.",
